      "romaji": "ta",
      "audioKey": "audio.hira.ta",
      "confusableIds": [],
      "tipZh": "た 有四笔：左侧横和撇，右侧上下两短笔；右侧没有圈。"
    },
    {
      "id": "kp.hira.chi",
      "kana": "ち",
      "romaji": "chi",
      "audioKey": "audio.hira.chi",
      "confusableIds": [
        "kp.hira.ki"
      ],
      "tipZh": "ち 有两笔：横，向下穿过横后转向右、再弯向左下；上方只有一横。"
    },
    {
      "id": "kp.hira.tsu",
      "kana": "つ",
      "romaji": "tsu",
      "audioKey": "audio.hira.tsu",
      "confusableIds": [
        "kp.hira.ku",
        "kp.hira.shi"
      ],
      "tipZh": "つ 一笔写成，先向右再弯向左下；整体横向展开，别和纵向的 し 混淆。"
    },
    {
      "id": "kp.hira.te",
      "kana": "て",
      "romaji": "te",
      "audioKey": "audio.hira.te",
      "confusableIds": [],
      "tipZh": "て 一笔写成：上方横线向右，再折向左下、弯向右收；没有圈。"
    },
    {
      "id": "kp.hira.to",
      "kana": "と",
      "romaji": "to",
      "audioKey": "audio.hira.to",
      "confusableIds": [],
      "tipZh": "と 有两笔：左上短斜笔，再写向左下绕到右侧的弧线；没有圈。"
    }
  ],
